**Files written (all in `C:/LMFG/runs/B01-negative/work/out/`):**
- `plant-context.DRAFT.md`: the draft `## Plant context` profile. Everything taken from your two files is marked inferred, and every unanswered line says "not set". It records 27 open gaps.
- `plant-rates.DRAFT.md`: the draft rates block. All five rates are "not set".
- `onboarding-setup-run.md`: the full run output, which covers:
  - systems and connector results, with the setup steps for Microsoft 365, NetSuite and Fusion quoted word for word;
  - documents read, and the export files listed for confirmation one at a time;
  - the time setup report (one row per data source);
  - export specs for IT covering maintenance, production, downtime, quality, planning, NetSuite and historian;
  - the setup summary, and the approval draft with its internal rates section (no values);
  - the gaps list, each item with the affected skills and how they degrade;
  - the missing-data list of 45 open questions;
  - the connector options table.

**What I could not do:**
- **The finance rates memo is missing.** You said it was there, but `inputs/plant` holds only `plant_overview.md` and `equipment.csv`. All five rates are recorded as not set, and nothing was guessed or filled in as a placeholder.
- **Profile not saved and page not built.** Nothing was written to `plant-setup/plant-context.md` or `plant-rates.md`, and no config page was rendered or published. Both wait on a yes and the name of the person approving.
- **No connector was tested live.** Microsoft 365, NetSuite and Fusion have no tools in this session, and I made no connection attempt.
- **The clock check between systems was not run.** No event recorded in two systems is available. The production-day start, the per-source time zones and planned production time are open questions.
